<h2>~rCommander Elrik</h2>
<p>I wouldnt mind BUT IM UNDER ATTACK!!!!

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~wLord of Sun</h2>
<p>I cannot withstand this assault much longer....

[ai2TempleDead]
